OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cool and rather cloudy day
OL,6,Fwith occasional showers, more frequent
OL,7,Facross the north. Drier with a few
OL,8,Fbrighter intervals around lunchtime.
OL,9,FModerate northerly breeze in coastal
OL,10,Fareas.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FCloudy with showers or longer
OL,13,Fspells of rain in the evening.
OL,14,FBecoming generally drier overnight but
OL,15,Fstill cloudy with a few light showers.
OL,16,
OL,17,CFriday:FCool and mostly cloudy through
OL,18,Fthe day, best of any brighter spells
OL,19,Fin the evening. Mostly dry after a few
OL,20,Flight showers in the early morning.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
