OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FSome
OL,6,Fearly sun on Saturday then cloudier
OL,7,Fwith scattered light showers. Sunday
OL,8,Fcloudy with a few showers, freshening
OL,9,Fsouthwesterly winds. Dry and warmer
OL,10,Fwith bright or sunny spells on Monday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
